    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[0].sentence
      value: Whoa!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[1].sentence
      value: ...okay then.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[2].sentence
      value: Oh thank god. Okay so, um, you remember what they said in the briefing?
        Like actually remember, not just nodded along?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[3].sentence
      value: I mean... some of it? It was a lot of talking.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[4].sentence
      value: It was ten minutes dude.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[5].sentence
      value: Felt longer.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[6].sentence
      value: Okay whatever, so, the Stone. You know, the big rock, nobody's ever
        figured out what the writing means.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[7].sentence
      value: Right, right, the rock thing.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[8].sentence
      value: Yeah so apparently there's like, a whole site underground now, with
        the same writing on it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[9].sentence
      value: Which, I don't know, isn't supposed to be possible? I wasn't really
        listening to the science part.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[10].sentence
      value: So basically we don't know anything.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[11].sentence
      value: Yeah
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[12].sentence
      value: Cool.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[13].sentence
      value: Anyway, um, where are you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[14].sentence
      value: Still on my own out here. You?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[15].sentence
      value: Heading in. Android's, uh, already ahead of us somehow.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[16].sentence
      value: ...Of course he is.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[17].sentence
      value: Just... get moving, okay? I'll try and keep the signal up.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[1].hasChoices
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3169902739311595065, guid: 64e51705bf6ce5d4d8987fd077698019, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[0].speakerName
      value: Cool
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
